# A great run on North Beach (the score tiers' measure): down Columbus along the square every 10 s (the
# teleport stands in for pushing back up; before the squeeze it was down from Broadway, 9,612): a kickflip
# into a manual, a 360 flip out of it into another, a varial heelflip into a third, ollied out: 9,630;
# twelve, 115,560. Pro (17,500) on the second, Sick
# (105,000) on the eleventh. A decent run (a kickflip to manual, a heelflip to manual, 2,992, every 20 s)
# scores 17,952.
